{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47955","headline":"诗二首 二 · 虎丘山石壁鬼","name":"诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神仙不可学，形化空游魂。\n白日非我朝，青松爲我门。\n虽复隔幽显，犹知念子孙。\n何以遣悲惋，万物归其根。\n寄语世上人，莫厌临芳尊。\n庄生问枯骨，三乐成虚言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虎丘山石壁鬼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}